+//! A rounding that vanishes at its spine's end vertex V, where its faces come
+//! tangent, whose walk stopped short of V where the contact on one face F
+//! left F across an edge E ending at V into a face Fn that goes on
+//! tangentially from F and is tangent to the blend's other face Fo along an
+//! edge from V: between Fn and Fo the ball has no width, so the rounding
+//! ends there. Whether the end of SD (its start with isFirst) is such, its
+//! contacts within Reach of V and within Width of each other.
+bool ChFi3d_ContactOntoTangentFaceAtEnd(const occ::handle<ChFiDS_SurfData>& SD,
+                                        const bool                          isFirst,
+                                        const TopoDS_Vertex&                V,
+                                        const TopOpeBRepDS_DataStructure&   DStr,
+                                        const ChFiDS_Map&                   EFMap,
+                                        const double                        Reach,
+                                        const double                        Width);
+
 #endif
